# server/ai/prompts/

Phase 2 will populate this directory with one `.md` file per prompt template,
each loaded by `server.ai.llm_client`.

Currently the prompts live inline in `backend_api.py` (`load_prompt` reads
from a hard-coded `ai_workspace/prompts/` directory).

Phase 1: empty placeholder. Adding a `.gitkeep` so the folder survives across
git commits.